<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30377" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκοπ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>incision</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.38
			</span></i>; <i>fracture</i> of skull, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				46.12.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>steps</i> cut in the wall of wells, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Ael.Dion.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				90
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>hindrance</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴησις προκοπῆς ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heraclit.
					131
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>D.</u>
				3.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
				9.12
			</span></i>, Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				2.7
			</span></i> (pl.); material <i>obstacle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.32
			</span></i>; <i>interruption, check</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἁρμονίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Comp.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ λόγου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					2p.514S.
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Protr.</u>
				21
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ἐγκοπάς</span>
			<i>disjointedly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				41.3
			</span></i>.</div>
